{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2022-06-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'PULTEGROUP GIFTS NEW MORTGAGE-FREE HOME TO WOUNDED ARMY VETERAN IN TENNESSEE', 'text': "NASHVILLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITED STATES ARMY SPECIALIST CHRISTOPHER LEWIS WAS PRESENTED WITH THE KEYS TO HIS NEW, MORTGAGE-FREE CENTEX HOME DURING A SPECIAL DEDICATION CEREMONY LAST MONTH. LOCATED IN THE RUCKER LANDING COMMUNITY IN MURFREESBORO, LEWIS WAS SELECTED TO RECEIVE THE HOME THROUGH PULTEGROUP'S BUILT TO HONOR® PROGRAM. “IT WAS A GREAT HONOR FOR US TO BUILD THIS HOME FOR THE LEWIS FAMILY AND WELCOME THEM TO THE RUCKER LANDING COMMUNITY,” SAID MELANIE HEMINGWAY, VICE PRESIDENT OF SALE"}